  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.0: Separated GPU-accelerated extensions into dedicated package. Requires only ILGPU dependencies for GPU-bound calculations. Multi-targets .NET 8, 9, and 10. All GPU methods provide up to 100x performance improvement on large datasets while maintaining full compatibility with CPU fallback. Install this package alongside Mavusi.Linq.DataScience to access GPU-accelerated methods.",
